Blocking:   nothing for 1.56s, then 452 characters at once
Streaming:  first characters after 0.76s, all 483 after 1.29s

Time before the reader sees anything: 1.56s vs 0.76s — 2.0x better

Total time is roughly the same. What changes is the waiting, and waiting is
the part users experience. Chapter 28 treats this as a latency technique.
